{"id": "141171", "name": "לכסון - 3 על 3 - מלא", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "diag_matrixify", "params": ["expr"], "body": "if matrixp (expr) then expr else matrix ([expr])"}, {"name": "diag_zeropad_row", "params": ["r", "indent", "width"], "body": "block([right: width - (left + length(r))],append (makelist (0, indent), r, makelist (0, right)))"}, {"name": "diago", "params": ["lst"], "body": "block ([lst: map (diag_matrixify, lst), width, height, left: 0, rows: []],width: lsum (length (first (A)), A, lst), height: lsum (length (A), A, lst), for A in lst do ( for r in args(A) do  rows: cons (diag_zeropad_row (r, left, width), rows), left: left + length (first (A))), apply (matrix, reverse (rows)))"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "collify", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([cols:[]],for i:1 thru length(transpose(M)) do(cols: endcons(col(M,i),cols)),cols)"}, {"name": "isEigVec", "params": ["M", "v"], "body": "is(rank(matrify([v,M.v]))=1)"}, {"name": "leavefalses", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "delete(true,map(lambda([ex],if pred(ex) then true else ex), lst))"}, {"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "integermatrixp", "params": ["M"], "body": "zeromatrixp(matrixmap(lambda([exp],if integerp(exp) then 0 else 1),M))"}, {"name": "divmat", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([mat:M], mat: if (integermatrixp(mat/2)) then mat/2 else mat, mat: if (integermatrixp(mat/2)) then mat/2 else mat, mat: if (integermatrixp(mat/3)) then mat/3 else mat, mat: if (integermatrixp(mat/5)) then mat/5 else mat, mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "sols", "params": ["i"], "body": "if (i<=length(eigvals)) then [eigvals[i],bases[i]] else [x,[]]", "array": true}, {"name": "containedIn", "params": ["lst1", "lst2"], "body": "is(sublist(lst1,lambda([exp],not member(exp,lst2)))=[])"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{3\\times 3}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A= {{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">ענו על השאלות הבאות. חשוב מאוד להקפיד על כללי ההזנה של מערכת הסטאק. לכן מומלץ בכל מקום להעתיק ולהדביק את דוגמית התשובה ואז לשנות את התשובה כך שתשקף את הנתונים האמיתיים שרציתם להזין!</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p_A(x)\\)</span>, הפולינום האופייני של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(p_A(x)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">שימו לב כי עליכם לכתוב ביטוי במשתנה היחיד x. למשל: <code dir=\"ltr\">x^3+3*x^2+3*x+1</code> (חשוב מאוד להזין במפורש את סימני הכפל בדיוק כמו בדוגמה).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>מהם הערכים העצמיים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הזינו אותם כרשימת מספרים <b>ללא חזרות</b>. למשל: <code dir=\"ltr\">[1,2,3]</code></p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><p>לכל מרחב עצמי של המטריצה שמימדו גדול מ-0, הזינו את הערך העצמי המתאים לו ובסיס למרחב העצמי. הזינו כל מרחב\\ערך עצמי שכזה <b>בדיוק פעם אחת</b>.</p><p>אם אין צורך בשדות מסוימים (יש פחות משלושה מרחבים עצמיים לא-טריוויאלים), הזינו במקום המתאים לערך העצמי x ובמקום המתאים לבסיס <code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code>. המערכת תתעלם מכל מרחב עצמי שבביטוי שהזנתם עבור הערך העצמי שלו מופיעים משתנים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lambda_1=\\) [[input:eig1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:eig1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(V_{\\lambda_1}=span\\) [[input:base1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:base1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lambda_2=\\) [[input:eig2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:eig2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(V_{\\lambda_2}=span\\) [[input:base2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:base2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lambda_3=\\) [[input:eig3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:eig3]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(V_{\\lambda_3}=span\\) [[input:base3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:base3]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">דוגמה להזנת קלט: עבור</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:1}}</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">נזין (לא להעתיק שוב את המילה span שכבר מופיעה בדף!)</p><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.92em;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lambda_1=\\) <code dir=\"ltr\">3</code><br>\\(V_{\\lambda_1}=span\\) <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([1],[0],[0]),matrix([0],[0],[1])]</code><br>\\(\\lambda_2=\\) <code dir=\"ltr\">2</code><br>\\(V_{\\lambda_2}=span\\) <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([0],[1],[0])]</code><br>\\(\\lambda_3=\\) <code dir=\"ltr\">x</code><br>\\(V_{\\lambda_3}=span\\) <code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code></div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ד׳</span></div><p>האם המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> לכסינה? (True=כן, False=לא)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:dgzable]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:dgzable]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>\n<p>[[feedback:prt2]]</p>\n<p>[[feedback:prt3]]</p>\n<p>[[feedback:prt4]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "base1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 50, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "base2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 50, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "base3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 50, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "dgzable", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "eig1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "eig2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "eig3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varlist: listofvars(ans1);\ngoodvars: is(varlist=[x] or varlist=[]);\n\ngooddeg: is(hipow(ans1,x)=n);\nmetukan: is(coeff(ans1,x,n)=1 or coeff(ans1,x,n)=-1);\ncorpol: is(expand(ans1)=charpol or expand(-ans1)=charpol);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodvars", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הקלט שהזנת אינו תקין. יש להזין פולינום במשתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> בלבד.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "gooddeg", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. מעלת פולינום אופייני של מטריצה מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\times{{CT:2}}\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> בדיוק.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "metukan", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. המקדם המוביל של פולינום אופייני תמיד שווה 1 בערכו המוחלט.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "corpol", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הפולינום שהזנת הוא אכן הפולינום האופייני של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה, הפולינום שהזנת אינו הפולינום האופייני של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "norepeats: is(length(unique(ans2))=length(ans2));\ngoodlength: is(length(ans2)<=n);\n\ngoodvals: containedIn(ans2,eigvals);\nwrongvals: sublist(ans2,lambda([exp],not member(exp,eigvals)));\nallvals: containedIn(eigvals,ans2);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "norepeats", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> ברשימת הערכים העצמיים שהזנת יש חזרות.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodlength", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הזנת יותר מדי ערכים עצמיים. למטריצה מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\times{{CT:2}}\\)</span> יש לכל היותר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> ערכים עצמיים.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodvals", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt2-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. מתוך הערכים שהזנת, הערכים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({@wrongvals@}\\)</span> אינם ערכים עצמיים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "allvals", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> תשובתך נכונה. הזנת את רשימת כל הערכים העצמיים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. לא כל הערכים העצמיים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> מופיעים ברשימה שהזנת.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "voidsol(s):= not numberp(s[1]);\nstudsols: leavefalses(voidsol, [[eig1,base1],[eig2,base2],[eig3,base3]]);\nremoved: is(length(studsols) < 3);\nstudeigs: map(first,studsols);\nstudbases: map(second, studsols);\nvalidInput: alltrue(lambda([vlst],alltrue(lambda([v],is(matrixp(v) and length(v)=3 and length(transpose(v))=1)),vlst)),studbases);\nstudsols: if (validInput) then studsols else [];\n\ndifferenteigenvals: is(length(unique(studeigs)) = length(studsols));\n\ndepsols: map(first,sublist(studsols,lambda([sol],dependentvects(sol[2]))));\n\nnotsubspacesol: map(first,sublist(studsols,lambda([sol],not alltrue(lambda([v],is(A.v=sol[1]*v)),sol[2]))));\n\neigspace(a):= args(nullspace(a*ident(3)-A));\nnotsupspacesol: map(first,sublist(studsols,lambda([sol],not inSpan(sol[2],eigspace(sol[1])))));\n\nalleigs: containedIn(eigvals,studeigs);\n\nperfect: is(depsols = [] and notsubspacesol=[] and notsupspacesol=[] and alleigs);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "removed", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 7, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">המערכת זיהתה הזנה של <span dir=\"ltr\">{@length(studsols)@}</span> מרחבים עצמיים, המתאימים לערכים <span dir=\"ltr\">{@studeigs@}</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 7, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "differenteigenvals", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt3-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הזנת את אותו הערך העצמי יותר מפעם אחת. יתכן שיופיעו שגיאות במשוב שתקבל.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "depsols", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt3-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt3-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">עבור המרחבים העצמיים המתאימים לערכים <span dir=\"ltr\">{@depsols@}</span>